        <Summary xml:lang="en">File manager from Dux Labs</Summary>
        <Description xml:lang="en">Dux Files is a standalone file manager for Wayland. A small Go daemon does the file work and a Quickshell UI sits on top of it. It looks and feels like the rest of the dux desktop and picks up Dux Shell&apos;s colors when DMS is running, but it works fine on its own.
